title: 'HRMP: widen the accepted origins and weigh the heaviest request a para makes'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    In Polkadot HRMP: Widen the accepted origins for some calls, in preparation for AHMv2, and
    expose a function to get the maximum weight for a request made by a parachain for itself.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: minor
